{"authored" [{"question" "q-51148" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{x+4}{({x}^{2}+4)x}=\\frac{-x+B}{{x}^{2}+4}+\\frac{1}{x},\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $B?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/state.json" "file_sha256" "8258eb37dbbd7a8d4213ea9c431e299ce27b8eba96c31bf2a029f955a927c8db" "basis" 616 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51148" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $({x}^{2}+4)x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+4 & =(-x+B)x+({x}^{2}+4).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=1$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(1)+4 & =(-1+B)(1)+({1}^{2}+4) \\\\ 5 & =-1+B+5 \\\\ B & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/state.json" "file_sha256" "8258eb37dbbd7a8d4213ea9c431e299ce27b8eba96c31bf2a029f955a927c8db" "basis" 616 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51148" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "18e02840c5d40a7706b746c87225c318d9d85bb25aa3cd2d829ce1113630a3da" "basis" 616 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-51148" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13954117/state.json" "file_sha256" "8258eb37dbbd7a8d4213ea9c431e299